{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/transport/transport-mechanisms/","source":"students/subjects/biology/transport/transport-mechanisms.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Transport Mechanisms | Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/transport/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700\">← Back to Transport Systems</a>\n        </nav>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Transport Mechanisms</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">How materials move through plants and animals</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Learning Objectives</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>• Compare transport systems in plants and animals</li>\n                        <li>• Understand the mechanisms of material movement</li>\n                        <li>• Explain adaptations for efficient transport</li>\n                        <li>• Analyze factors affecting transport rates</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Video Content -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Video Lessons</h2>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 mb-4\">\n                        <iframe title=\"Transport Systems Overview\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"w-full h-[400px] rounded-lg\"></iframe>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 1: Plant Transport</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Xylem, phloem, and transpiration</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 2: Animal Transport</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Blood circulation and heart function</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Key Concepts -->\n                <section class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Key Concepts</h2>\n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Plant Transport Systems</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Xylem tissue:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Structure and adaptation</li>\n                                    <li>- Water transport</li>\n                                    <li>- Mineral transport</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Phloem tissue:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Structure and function</li>\n                                    <li>- Sugar transport</li>\n                                    <li>- Source to sink movement</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Transpiration:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Water movement</li>\n                                    <li>- Affecting factors</li>\n                                    <li>- Stomatal control</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Animal Transport</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Blood components:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Red blood cells</li>\n                                    <li>- White blood cells</li>\n                                    <li>- Platelets</li>\n                                    <li>- Plasma</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Heart structure:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Chambers</li>\n                                    <li>- Valves</li>\n                                    <li>- Blood vessels</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Circulation patterns:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Pulmonary circuit</li>\n                                    <li>- Systemic circuit</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Transport Mechanisms</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Passive transport:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Diffusion</li>\n                                    <li>- Osmosis</li>\n                                    <li>- Facilitated diffusion</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Active transport:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Protein pumps</li>\n                                    <li>- Energy requirements</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. System Efficiency</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Surface area adaptations</li>\n                            <li>• Pressure differences</li>\n                            <li>• Transport rates</li>\n                            <li>• Energy costs</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practical Activities -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practical Activities</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Plant Studies</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Transpiration experiments</li>\n                                <li>• Xylem observation</li>\n                                <li>• Root pressure demos</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Animal Studies</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Blood smear examination</li>\n                                <li>• Heart rate measurements</li>\n                                <li>• Blood pressure testing</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Assessment Questions -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Self-Assessment</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Compare transport in plants and animals.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Consider efficiency, energy use, and adaptations.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Explain how transpiration helps water movement in plants.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include environmental factors and control mechanisms.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Describe the path of blood through the heart.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include chambers, vessels, and direction of flow.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}